OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'in shock' after
OL,4,Aexplosion at house
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are at a security alert in north
OL,7,FBelfast after an explosion at a house
OL,8,Fin the early hours of Friday morning.
OL,10,FResidents in the Stanhope Street area
OL,11,Fare being evacuated and cordons are in
OL,12,Fplace.
OL,14,FMembers of the public, including
OL,15,Fdrivers, are asked to avoid the area.
OL,17,FSinn Fein councillor JJ Magee said the
OL,18,Flocal community is in "shock".
